      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        136.0631103515625,
        121.37181091308594,
        408.2083435058594,
        128.87181091308594
      ],
      "text": "Fair E, Miller C, Cattamanchi A, Morrison J, Hopewell P, Curry International Tuberculosis",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 7.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        136.07061767578125,
        133.37181091308594,
        330.98052978515625,
        140.87181091308594
      ],
      "text": "Center, University of California, San Francisco, California, USA",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 7.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        136.0631103515625,
        162.10533142089844,
        179.4611053466797,
        171.10533142089844
      ],
      "text": "RATIONALE",
      "font": "TheSansSemiBold-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        136.0631103515625,
        180.27603149414062,
        408.1961669921875,
        189.27603149414062
      ],
      "text": "The identiﬁcation and evaluation of persons in close contact with an",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        136.0631103515625,
        192.27304077148438,
        408.205078125,
        201.27304077148438
      ],
      "text": "infectious tuberculosis (TB) patient (contact investigation) has been",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        136.07212829589844,
        204.27005004882812,
        408.2138977050781,
        213.27005004882812
      ],
      "text": "viewed as an expensive, low-priority endeavour in low- and middle-",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        136.0901336669922,
        216.26705932617188,
        408.2137756347656,
        225.26705932617188
      ],
      "text": "income countries. Increasing concern about failure to meet case",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        136.0901336669922,
        228.1278076171875,
        408.2193908691406,
        237.26406860351562
      ],
      "text": "Mycobacterium tuberculosis detection targets, with the spread of",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Italic",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        136.08660888671875,
        240.26406860351562,
        410.1452941894531,
        249.26406860351562
      ],
      "text": "to vulnerable people such as children and people with HIV infection",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        136.0596160888672,
        252.12481689453125,
        410.181640625,
        261.2610778808594
      ],
      "text": "M. tuberculosis and with the transmission of drug-resistant  , have,",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Italic",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        136.09564208984375,
        264.2580871582031,
        408.0576171875,
        273.2760925292969
      ],
      "text": "however, prompted reassessment of the potential beneﬁts of contact",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        136.05062866210938,
        276.2731018066406,
        408.3004455566406,
        285.2731018066406
      ],
      "text": "investigation. The goal of this review was to update a systematic review",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        136.1766357421875,
        288.26983642578125,
        408.2856750488281,
        297.2701110839844
      ],
      "text": "by Morrison et al. published in 2008 (1), that included studies through",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        136.1529083251953,
        300.266845703125,
        408.1596374511719,
        309.266845703125
      ],
      "text": "2005. In particular, we were interested in examining studies that",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        136.1619110107422,
        312.26385498046875,
        408.32177734375,
        321.26385498046875
      ],
      "text": "included information on the drug susceptibility of the index case strain",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        136.17991638183594,
        324.2608642578125,
        341.9288024902344,
        333.2608642578125
      ],
      "text": "and on the HIV status of the index case and contacts.",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        136.1889190673828,
        354.087158203125,
        178.28192138671875,
        363.087158203125
      ],
      "text": "METHODS",
      "font": "TheSansSemiBold-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        136.1889190673828,
        372.25787353515625,
        408.17791748046875,
        381.27587890625
      ],
      "text": "We conducted a systematic review and meta-analysis to determine the",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        136.05392456054688,
        384.27288818359375,
        408.2225036621094,
        393.27288818359375
      ],
      "text": "yield of household contact investigation. Two electronic databases",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        136.0899200439453,
        396.2698974609375,
        408.1983642578125,
        405.2700500488281
      ],
      "text": "(PubMed and Embase) were searched for primary studies from January",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        136.06533813476562,
        408.2670593261719,
        408.2249755859375,
        417.2670593261719
      ],
      "text": "2006 through August 2011 with the same search terms as in the",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        136.10133361816406,
        420.1278076171875,
        408.1172180175781,
        429.2640686035156
      ],
      "text": "‘Mycobacterium tuberculosis’ previous review: ‘tuberculosis’,  , ‘contact",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Italic",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        136.1103515625,
        432.2610778808594,
        408.2430725097656,
        441.2610778808594
      ],
      "text": "tracing’, ‘contact investigation’ and ‘household contact.’ The aim of the",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        136.11935424804688,
        444.2580871582031,
        408.1733093261719,
        453.2760925292969
      ],
      "text": "search strategy was to identify all studies that evaluated the number",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        136.04933166503906,
        456.2728576660156,
        408.1821594238281,
        465.2728576660156
      ],
      "text": "of cases of active TB or latent tuberculosis infection (LTBI) found when",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        136.04933166503906,
        468.26983642578125,
        408.06500244140625,
        477.26983642578125
      ],
      "text": "contact investigation was conducted among household members of",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        135.9323272705078,
        480.2668151855469,
        408.08319091796875,
        489.2668151855469
      ],
      "text": "people with active pulmonary TB (index cases). All published articles on",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        135.95033264160156,
        492.2638244628906,
        408.1009521484375,
        501.2638244628906
      ],
      "text": "the yield of household contact investigation, including cross-sectional",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        135.97732543945312,
        504.2608337402344,
        408.3173828125,
        513.2608642578125
      ],
      "text": "and prospective studies, were included. The language of the publications",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        136.184326171875,
        516.2578735351562,
        272.1383361816406,
        525.2758178710938
      ],
      "text": "reviewed was restricted to English.",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        226.1114044189453,
        651.97265625,
        233.10140991210938,
        659.47265625
      ],
      "text": "55",
